    "notices/natural-earth.txt":"Made with Natural Earth. Map subunits 5.1.1 and minor islands 4.1.0. Natural Earth places its raster/vector data in the public domain, including modification and commercial redistribution: https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/. Generalized cartographic geometry is not an award-eligibility determination. Clacks authors the factual DXCC correspondence and explicit omissions/exclusions.\n",
    "notices/noaa.txt":"Coordinate correction grid us_noaa_pvhpgn.tif, NOAA National Geodetic Survey / PROJ-data. The original grid metadata states public domain. Source and metadata: https://cdn.proj.org/us_noaa_pvhpgn.tif and https://github.com/OSGeo/PROJ-data/tree/cdab44864a36a9f3c3e90a36637c5d8a86e624c6. EPSG:1731 uses the NAD83-to-HARN grid and approximates HARN as WGS84; stated operation accuracy is separate from Census boundary accuracy.\n"
